; The one variable: a heading seated through a `parent_id_path` that enters an instance, then named
; by its `%Name`. `Cap` finds `Player/Inner` through its trail and claims `%Cap` in the root's table,
; so `parent="%Cap"` seats the green Hat under Cap (node.cpp:1930-1938, packed_scene.cpp:565-570):
; it sits right of the orange Cap, beside Inner's blue box. No other golden names such a heading.

